{"h": {"measure": "A", "k": 20}, "sp": "nb", "rep": 106, "hyps": [{"edit_edge": 3, "edit_op": "skip_connect", "cond_edge": 3, "cond_op": "none", "direction": "higher", "why": "Adding the input-to-output residual where none exists gives large gains (exps 1-2), much more than swapping skip in for an existing op."}, {"edit_edge": 3, "edit_op": "nor_conv_3x3", "cond_edge": 3, "cond_op": "skip_connect", "direction": "lower", "why": "Replacing the residual skip with a conv removes the identity path and hurts badly (exp 16), unlike replacing avg_pool (exp 17)."}, {"edit_edge": 5, "edit_op": "nor_conv_3x3", "cond_edge": 1, "cond_op": "none", "direction": "lower", "why": "With node 0->2 removed, node 2 is starved, so a conv on edge 5 adds little (exp 4 vs 3, 5)."}, {"edit_edge": 5, "edit_op": "skip_connect", "cond_edge": 3, "cond_op": "none", "direction": "higher", "why": "Without the input-output skip, a skip on edge 5 gives a shorter gradient path and helps a lot (exp 20)."}, {"edit_edge": 5, "edit_op": "avg_pool_3x3", "cond_edge": 3, "cond_op": "skip_connect", "direction": "lower", "why": "When the residual exists, swapping the conv on 2->3 for pooling only loses capacity (exp 18 vs 19)."}, {"edit_edge": 0, "edit_op": "nor_conv_3x3", "cond_edge": 4, "cond_op": "none", "direction": "lower", "why": "If node 1 has no direct path to the output, adding a conv into node 1 contributes little (exp 7 vs 6)."}, {"edit_edge": 0, "edit_op": "nor_conv_3x3", "cond_edge": 0, "cond_op": "none", "direction": "higher", "why": "Filling a missing edge 0 revives node 1 and its downstream edges, a larger gain than replacing skip or pool."}, {"edit_edge": 4, "edit_op": "nor_conv_3x3", "cond_edge": 0, "cond_op": "none", "direction": "lower", "why": "With edge 0 removed, node 1 outputs zero, so a conv on edge 1->3 is useless (exp 13 vs 12)."}, {"edit_edge": 1, "edit_op": "none", "cond_edge": 2, "cond_op": "none", "direction": "lower", "why": "Removing 0->2 when 1->2 is already absent kills node 2 entirely, which hurts more (exp 11 vs 10)."}, {"edit_edge": 2, "edit_op": "avg_pool_3x3", "cond_edge": 1, "cond_op": "none", "direction": "lower", "why": "When edge 2 is node 2's only input, downgrading its conv to pooling cuts node 2's feature quality (exp 15 vs 14)."}], "tok": 15681, "bad": 0, "probes": [[["nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3", "none", "nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3"], [3, "skip_connect"]], [["nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3", "none", "nor_conv_3x3", "none"], [3, "skip_connect"]], [["nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3", "skip_connect", "nor_conv_3x3", "none"], [5, "nor_conv_3x3"]], [["nor_conv_3x3", "none", "none", "skip_connect", "nor_conv_3x3", "none"], [5, "nor_conv_3x3"]], [["nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3", "none", "skip_connect", "nor_conv_3x3", "none"], [5, "nor_conv_3x3"]], [["none", "nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3", "skip_connect", "nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3"], [0, "nor_conv_3x3"]], [["none", "nor_conv_3x3", "none", "skip_connect", "none", "nor_conv_3x3"], [0, "nor_conv_3x3"]], [["skip_connect", "nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3", "skip_connect", "nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3"], [0, "nor_conv_3x3"]], [["avg_pool_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3", "skip_connect", "nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3"], [0, "nor_conv_3x3"]], [["nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3", "skip_connect", "nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3"], [1, "none"]], [["nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3", "none", "skip_connect", "nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3"], [1, "none"]], [["nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3", "skip_connect", "none", "nor_conv_3x3"], [4, "nor_conv_3x3"]], [["none", "nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3", "skip_connect", "none", "nor_conv_3x3"], [4, "nor_conv_3x3"]], [["nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_1x1", "skip_connect", "nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3"], [2, "avg_pool_3x3"]], [["nor_conv_3x3", "none", "nor_conv_1x1", "skip_connect", "nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3"], [2, "avg_pool_3x3"]], [["nor_conv_3x3", "nor_conv_3x3", "n